        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>INOX SE103, Stainless Steel Oslo Lever with Square SE Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Oslo Stainless Steel Leverset is available in satin stainless steel and polished stainless steel finishes. The Oslo Lever with SE Rosette will fit 1-3/8 inch to 1-3/4 inch thick doors with standard backsets of 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. This modern curved lever is easy to install and features concealed screw mounting for a clean look. It is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/INX-SE103-specifications.gif?v=1704354607\" width=\"225\" height=\"200\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" atl=\"INX-SE103 specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Stainless Steel Oslo Leverset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits most standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li>Hollow stainless steel lever.</li>\r\n<li>Latch: 28 Degrees Retraction (TL4 Latch)</li>\r\n<li>Concealed Installation</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the INOX 103 Oslo Lever with SE Rosette:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Length: 2-3/8\" square</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection: 7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Hub and Spindle: 5/16\" (8mm) Square</li>\r\n<li>Latch Faceplate: 1\" x 2-1/4\" Standard Square Corner</li>\r\n<li>Latch Strike: Full Lip Strike and T-Strike with Square Corners.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> No door latch. Stationary door lever on one side of the door. Package Includes: 1 lever, 1 rose, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Note: Single Dummy is Handed</b>. All other functions are non-handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"left\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/INX-Finish-2.jpg?v=1704354575\" width=\"401\" height=\"121\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Inox Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Oslo Stainless Steel Leverset",
                "description": "The Oslo Stainless Steel Leverset is available in satin stainless steel and polished stainless steel finishes. The Oslo Lever with SE Rosette will fit 1-3/8 inch to 1-3/4 inch thick doors with standard backsets of 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. This modern curved lever is easy to install and features concealed screw mounting for a clean look. It is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.",
